{"ref":"BDB, תְּפִלָּה","hw":"תְּפִלָּה","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">תְּפִלָּה</span></big><sub>77</sub>  <strong>n.f. prayer</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.15\">Is 1:15</a> +, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּפִלַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:5\" href=\"/Psalms.80.5\">ψ 80:5</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּפִלָּתִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 4:2\" href=\"/Psalms.4.2\">4:2</a> +, etc.; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּפִלּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 72:20\" href=\"/Psalms.72.20\">72:20</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>prayer</em>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:38\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.38\">1 K 8:38</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:29\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.29\">2 Ch 6:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.15\">Is 1:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:13\" href=\"/Psalms.35.13\">ψ 35:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:5\" href=\"/Psalms.80.5\">80:5</a> +. <strong>b.</strong>  <em>pray a prayer</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְפ׳ ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 7:27\" href=\"/II_Samuel.7.27\">2 S 7:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:54\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.54\">1 K 8:54</a> (cf. v <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:28\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.28\">28</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:29\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.29\">29</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.19\">2 Ch 6:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.20\">20</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּבֶּר בַּתּ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:21\" href=\"/Daniel.9.21\">Dn 9:21</a>; specif. of intercession, <span dir=\"rtl\">נשׂא ת׳</span>, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּעַד</span> <em>in behalf of</em> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:4\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.4\">2 K 19:4</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.4\">Is 37:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 7:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.7.16\">Je 7:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 11:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.11.14\">11:14</a>. <strong>c.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳ אֶל־אֱלֹהִים</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 33:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.33.18\">2 Ch 33:18</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">לְאֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 42:9\" href=\"/Psalms.42.9\">ψ 42:9</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 69:14\" href=\"/Psalms.69.14\">69:14</a>; c. vb. + <span dir=\"rtl\">לפני</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:3\" href=\"/Psalms.88.3\">88:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 141:2\" href=\"/Psalms.141.2\">141:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תּ׳ תְּקַדְּמֶ֑ךָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 88:14\" href=\"/Psalms.88.14\">88:14</a>. <strong>d.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">בית ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 56:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.56.7\">Is 56:7</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <em>house of prayer</em> (temple); c. vb. + <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל־י׳</span> + <span dir=\"rtl\">אל־היכל</span> <a data-ref=\"Jonah 2:8\" href=\"/Jonah.2.8\">Jon 2:8</a>; c. vb. + <span dir=\"rtl\">למעון קדשׁו</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 30:27\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.30.27\">2 Ch 30:27</a>. <strong>e.</strong>  <em>hear prayer</em> is <span dir=\"rtl\">ת׳ (אֶת־) שׁמע</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:45\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.45\">1 K 8:45</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:49\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.49\">49</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:35\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.35\">2 Ch 6:35</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:39\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.39\">39</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 9:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.9.3\">1 K 9:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 4:2\" href=\"/Psalms.4.2\">ψ 4:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 39:13\" href=\"/Psalms.39.13\">39:13</a> + 9 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁמע אֶל־ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:28\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.28\">1 K 8:28</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:29\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.29\">29</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.19\">2 Ch 6:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:20\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.20\">20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 1:6\" href=\"/Nehemiah.1.6\">Ne 1:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 9:17\" href=\"/Daniel.9.17\">Dn 9:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">פנה אל ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:28\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.28\">1 K 8:28</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.19\">2 Ch 6:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:18\" href=\"/Psalms.102.18\">ψ 102:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אָזְנֶיךָ קַשֻּׁבוֹת לת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 6:40\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.6.40\">2 Ch 6:40</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 7:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.7.15\">7:15</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 1:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.1.11\">Ne 1:11</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אֶל)</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">הַקְשִׁיבָה ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 61:2\" href=\"/Psalms.61.2\">ψ 61:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הִקְשִׁיב בְּקוֹל ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:19\" href=\"/Psalms.66.19\">66:19</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">הַאֲזִינָה ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:1\" href=\"/Psalms.17.1\">17:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:2\" href=\"/Psalms.55.2\">55:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 86:6\" href=\"/Psalms.86.6\">86:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לקח ת׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 6:10\" href=\"/Psalms.6.10\">6:10</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 66:20\" href=\"/Psalms.66.20\">66:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:18\" href=\"/Psalms.102.18\">102:18b</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  in ψ-titles, poetic, liturgical prayer <a data-ref=\"Psalms 17:1\" href=\"/Psalms.17.1\">ψ 17:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 86:1\" href=\"/Psalms.86.1\">86:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 90:1\" href=\"/Psalms.90.1\">90:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 102:1\" href=\"/Psalms.102.1\">102:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 142:1\" href=\"/Psalms.142.1\">142:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:1\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.1\">Hb 3:1</a>; of Davidic Psalter, <span dir=\"rtl\">תפלות דוד</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 72:20\" href=\"/Psalms.72.20\">ψ 72:20</a>.","next":"BDB, פָּלָל","prev":"BDB, פָּלַל"}